Subject: [PATCH 07/18] feat(harness): Coding Harness distribution

harness/harness projects the core into .harness-aidlc and emits the host
shell: persona task agents (host/agents), the /aidlc prompt, the method
include list and the adapter extension. The orchestrator skill is the Claude
skill in the harness tool vocabulary, checked in and verified against its
derivation at build time. The bootstrap .harness/extensions/aidlc.ts is a
whole-file root integration that re-exports the adapter.

The adapter maps harness events onto the core hooks; code-execution tools
may not invoke the engine and meet the plan-approval guard as opaque tools.
The user guide gains a Coding Harness chapter and the shared docs list the
distribution.
